  - m_Id: 343984055509152
    m_Localized: LimboQuote
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509153
    m_Localized: The Limbo
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509154
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Tip </font></size>
      Level up your Mod Cards by merging two of the same card and level.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509155
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Tip </font></size>
      Sort your Player Hand and make the most of your Spread Cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509156
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Tip </font></size>
      Improve your stats in each run by triggering Temples.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509157
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Tip </font></size>
      Save up on Wails of the Abyss and upgrade your abilities!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509158
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Tip </font></size>
      Pick your preferred Signature Weapon by the altar in the Forum!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509159
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Tip </font></size>
      Underleveled? Try rearranging your Player Hand!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509160
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Mythos </font></size>
      Limbo harbors the souls of those who died without knowledge of Her glory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509161
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Mythos </font></size>
      The Forum is where all virtuous Poets of Limbo reside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509162
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Mythos </font></size>
      Spirit Cards are the physical embodiment of one's soul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509163
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Mythos </font></size>
      Each Circle of Hell has a native Brotchi species.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509164
    m_Localized: <size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Mythos </font></size>
      Beware, for the Tempest of Lust is unavoidable!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509165
    m_Localized: "<size=200%><font=\"CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30\">Mythos
      </font></size> Don\u2019t let the succubi fool you: the caverns of Lust are
      no place for romance!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509166
    m_Localized: '<size=200%><font="CSGrimore-Italic SDFAA 2k padding30">Mythos </font></size>
      In the afterlife, all human souls are granted Her likeness: that of a woman.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509167
    m_Localized: '"Abandon all hope, ye who enter here."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509168
    m_Localized: '"The gift that She most prizes, is the freedom of the will."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509169
    m_Localized: '"Where She governs, no thing depends upon the laws of nature."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509170
    m_Localized: '"Let mortals never take a vow in jest."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509171
    m_Localized: '"And in Her will there is our peace."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509172
    m_Localized: '"No hope for rest and none for lesser pain."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509173
    m_Localized: '"Let her be gone, for she was reckless, entering this realm."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509174
    m_Localized: '"Into the eternal dark, to fire and frost."'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
