  - m_Id: 343984055509235
    m_Localized: Player Hand
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509236
    m_Localized: Mod Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509237
    m_Localized: Card Level
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509238
    m_Localized: Main Attribute
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509239
    m_Localized: Card Color
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509240
    m_Localized: Background color indicates the card's type.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509241
    m_Localized: Description
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509242
    m_Localized: Explains the card's effects and statistics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509243
    m_Localized: 'Mod Cards modify and enhance your Weapon Cards during the run.


      Explore
      different combinations and refine your playstyle!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509244
    m_Localized: Mod Card Types
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509245
    m_Localized: Boost Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509246
    m_Localized: Cards that boost a single stat on an individual Weapon Card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509247
    m_Localized: 'There are various types of Mod Cards.


      Each type is indicated
      by the card''s background color.


      There are 5 different types of Mod
      Cards: <color=#ed5ed5>BOOST</color>, <color=#89ff91>EFFECT</color>, <color=#89d0ff>SPREAD</color>,
      <color=#fec801>MIRACLE</color> and <color=#cd78ef>CURSE</color>.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509248
    m_Localized: Effect Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509249
    m_Localized: Cards that apply extra effects to your Weapon Card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509250
    m_Localized: Spread Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509251
    m_Localized: "Cards that spread boosts and/or effects across multiple Weapon
      Cards. \n\nHow you position them in your hand is key!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509252
    m_Localized: Miracle Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509253
    m_Localized: Rare cards that grant multiple powerful boosts and/or effects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509254
    m_Localized: Curse Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509255
    m_Localized: Rare cards that give you an extraordinary advantage that comes at
      a significant cost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509256
    m_Localized: Merging Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509257
    m_Localized: "You can merge two copies of the same card to level it up! \n\nTo
      do this, drag one of them on top of the other in your Player Hand.\n\nYou'll
      know they're ready when there's an orange glow and you can see the merge symbol
      in the center!\n\nNote: You can only merge two cards of the same level."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509258
    m_Localized: Card Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509259
    m_Localized: "Mod Cards can be evolved up to level 3, and each level enhances
      your card's appearance. \n\nTheir base stats are increased with every level
      up!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509260
    m_Localized: Weapon Cards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509261
    m_Localized: Card Plating
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509262
    m_Localized: Border plating indicates the card's rarity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509263
    m_Localized: Card Title
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509264
    m_Localized: Description
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509265
    m_Localized: Explains how the weapon works against enemies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509266
    m_Localized: 'Weapon Cards are the different attacks you can collect throughout
      the run.


      Your Player Hand can hold up to 4 unique cards per run.


      Weapon
      Cards come in different rarities!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509267
    m_Localized: Player Hand Management
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509268
    m_Localized: This Spread Card affects both Weapon Cards to the left and right!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509269
    m_Localized: "Press {0} to move each Stack of Cards to your desired position.
      \n\nYou can also switch individual Mod Cards between different Weapon Cards."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509270
    m_Localized: Card Stats
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509271
    m_Localized: "You can hit {0} to view the Card Stats Menu at any time. \n\nAnalyze
      your Player Hand in full detail and strategize as needed!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509272
    m_Localized: Signature Weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509273
    m_Localized: Card Title
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509274
    m_Localized: Description
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509275
    m_Localized: Spell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509276
    m_Localized: Signature Weapon Cards represent unique abilities specific to each
      Poet of Limbo.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509277
    m_Localized: You can select your preferred Signature Weapon Card before each
      run at the pedestal in the Forum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509278
    m_Localized: Each Signature Weapon Card comes with an ultimate attack called
      a <i>Spell</i>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509279
    m_Localized: Spells
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509280
    m_Localized: Spells are powerful abilities unique to each Signature Weapon Card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509281
    m_Localized: Spell Token
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509282
    m_Localized: "Obtain the Spell Token during your run and hit {0} to unleash it
      upon your enemies. \n\nSave it for when you're in a pinch!\n\nWhen to use a
      Spell:"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509283
    m_Localized: Keep an eye on this indicator to know when you can use a Spell!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509284
    m_Localized: Charms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509285
    m_Localized: Silver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509286
    m_Localized: Bronze
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509287
    m_Localized: Gold
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509288
    m_Localized: "Offered by Beatrice herself, Charms give your stats a small power-up!\n
      \nHowever, they'll only affect your current run.\n\nThey come in 3 different
      rarities: bronze, silver and gold."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509289
    m_Localized: Wails of the Abyss
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509290
    m_Localized: 'The longer your run lasts, the more Wails of the Abyss you will
      collect.


      Use them as an offering at the Gates of Hell in exchange for
      permanent upgrades which you can level up.


      You can refund them at any
      time so you can experiment to your heart''s desire!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
