  - m_Id: 343984055509359
    m_Localized: Early Access
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509360
    m_Localized: 'Hell Maiden is currently in Early Access and will be receiving
      continuous support based on your feedback.


      As development progresses,
      we will be adding new levels, characters, cards, boss encounters and narrative
      events while improving the overall experience.


      Have fun traversing
      the depths of Hell!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509361
    m_Localized: Thank you for playing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 343984055509362
    m_Localized: 'You''ve reached the end of the current Early Access main storyline
      and progression.


      There''s more to explore, content to unlock, character
      interactions to experience and dozens of builds to tinker with, and we hope
      you''ll enjoy what Hell Maiden EA 1.0 has to offer!


      Your support means
      everything and we hope you''ll consider joining our open development process
      by leaving us your feedback and reviews on Steam.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
